title: Double Horn Honk on Keyless Exit Disable
raw_community_title: Disable double honk with exit of running vehicle
category: Chimes and Horn
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro & Lightning Community
source_sheet: F-150 Lightning FORScan Thread
notes: Disables horn double honk when exiting running vehicle with keyfob. Can also
  be set in Sync (Key Detection Alert).
steps:
- module: BCM
  address: 726-63-02
  mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
  nibbles:
  - nibble: 3
    recommended_hex: '0'
    community_instruction: Change from 1 to 0
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature_name: LostPKExteriorNotificationEnable_Cfg (LPKENEC)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
      feature_name: LostPKExteriorNotificationEnable_Cfg (LPKENEC)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: LostPKExteriorNotificationEnable_Cfg (LPKENEC)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
      feature_name: LostPKExteriorNotificationEnable_Cfg (LPKENEC)
      target_state: Disabled
validation_status: validated
